  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0497.nikai.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0497.nikai.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0497.nikai.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0497_nikai"><head>ΝΙΚΑΙ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0497-nikai-1">
              <head>I.</head>
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0497-nikai-1-l1">Τουτὶ προσαναβῆναι τὸ σιμὸν δεῖ.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">
                <bibl>Scholiasta Aristophanis Lysistr. 288:</bibl> τὸ σιμὸν ἀντὶ τοῦ πρόσαντες. καὶ ἐν Βαρυλωνίοις Μέσην ἔρειδε πρὸς τὸ σιμόν. καὶ Πλάτων ἐν Νίκαις Τουτὶ προσαναβῆναι τὸ σιμὸν δεῖ. Eadem <bibl>Suidas s. v. σιμός.</bibl>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">Legebatur ἀεὶ pro</note>
              <pb n="644" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.hxjhbd:scan:662" />
              <note type="apparatus">δεῖ. Correxit Elmsleius ad Acharn. 385. Idem Platonis nomen restituit. Vulgo καὶ πλατὺ ita ut cum Aristophanis loco coniunctum sit.</note>
            </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0497-nikai-2">
              <head>II.</head>
              <note type="source">
                <bibl>Scholiasta Aristophanis Av. 1297:</bibl>
                <quote>διαβάλλεται (Midias) εἰς πονηρίαν, ὡς Πλάτων Νίκαις.</quote>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">Hinc fluxit glossa Zonarae Lex. p. 1342. Μειδίας: κύριον, καὶ πονηρὸς Μειδίας, ubi mire errat editor.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0497-nikai-3">
              <head>III.</head>
              <note type="source">
                <bibl>Scholiasta Platonis Bekk. p. 331:</bibl>
                <quote>κωμῳδεῖται δὲ (Aristophanes) ὅτι καὶ τὸ τῆς Εἰρήνης κολοσσικὸν ἐξῆρεν ἄγαλμα. Εὔπολις Αὐτολύκῳ, Πλάτων Νίκαις.</quote>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">Vide ad Eupol. fragm. p. 440.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0497-nikai-4">
              <head>IV.</head>
              <note type="source">
                <bibl>Pollux VII 40:</bibl>
                <quote>ἰχθύων δὲ πλύμα Πλάτων ἐν Νίκαις εἴρηκεν ὁ κωμικός.</quote>
              </note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>